  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preserving endangered traditional crafts and enhancing employ-ability in the creative sector in Palestine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The project aims to contribute to enhancing the employability of young professionals and students in Cultural and Creative Industries , particularly in crafts, as well as to safeguard endangered crafts through documentation and inventorying of related traditional know-how.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Through creating synergies between crafts and their design, traditional skills and modern creativity, and supporting the different stages of the value chain framework, the targeted beneficiaries and institutions will have a better understanding of the dynamics of the creative domains. By the end of the project, beneficiaries will be equipped with the necessary tools and skills to explore the diverse arenas to boost crafts productions, including employing proper design methods, utilizing the digital environment for advancing innovative entrepreneurial initiatives while using creativity for economic enhancement. Capacity-building trainings, workshops, professional and student exchanges, competitions, and sub-grants will be offered to help preserve and advance traditional and contemporary local creative industries, focusing on the crafts domain.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
